  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2102.31 Method and Frequency of Reporting of Agriculture Water Use",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2102.31 Method and Frequency of Reporting of Agriculture Water Use. The agriculture water user shall submit the information required by Env-Wq 2102.29(c) and Env-Wq 2102.30 for the period beginning January 1 and ending December 31 of each year to the department no later than February 15 of the year immediately following the year being reported.\n\nSource. #9279, eff 9-24-08; ss by #12135, eff 3-21-17 (from Env-Wq 2102.30)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2100.html"
